catflow 0.8; events
1. On File                    receipts/; pattern=*.jpg; settle=10s
2. Read Image
3. Read Context               ledger.ctx
4. OCR                  (2)
5. Extract Structured         Qwen3 8B; "merchant, date, total, category"
6. Table to Text              format=csv; ctx+
7. Save Context               ledger.ctx
8. Count Context              entries
9. Compare                    "> 50"; tags: escalate, normal
   -> { escalate: 10 | normal: done }
10. Template                  "{1} receipts logged since the last report —
                              worth an early look before Sunday"
11. Save Text                 receipts/review-needed.txt
